{"repositoryId":1424899298,"availability":"available","full":"lk-nyoka/callback","name":"callback","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-18T23:07:44Z","updated":"2026-10-19T17:34:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://callback-psi-two.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://callback-psi-two.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:12.039Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:12.039Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:12.039Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:04:12.039Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Stop applying to everything. Start getting callbacks.","Callback is a private job-search assistant. It reads your CV into a Career Vault of facts you confirm, finds roles published on employers' own job boards, shows the hiring-signal evidence for each one, and drafts applications in which every line must cite a confirmed fact and pass the Claims Ledger: deterministic checks, plus a Nemotron audit that can only make a verdict stricter. Lines that fail are blocked or sent back to you. You approve the final pack, and Callback never sends anything for you.","Built for the Nebius x NVIDIA Global AI Hackathon 2026, Personal AI track. Models: NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Lightning, Nemotron 3 Super, Nemotron 3 Ultra and Nemotron 3.5 Super VL on Nebius Token Factory. Search: Tavily. License: MIT."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lk-nyoka/callback/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9572e51e5fe3ffcc12cb9be7602d78cbc84aff4f700aafbb292861c7b74840f1","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:12.129Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:12.129Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Stop applying to everything. Start getting callbacks.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lk-nyoka/callback/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Built for the Nebius x NVID